  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82b98cd8a7b05f18",
      "translationZh": "解决办法：以分离式/无界面模式运行服务器，而不是让它一直附着在控制台窗口上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69e783113b002eac",
      "translationZh": "RTX 5090，通过 ninfer 运行约 27B 的 NVFP4 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33096a480f7f8f7c",
      "translationZh": "终端获得焦点时：130–200 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5fd113ac40696f95",
      "translationZh": "终端失去焦点时：50–60 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cfbffa00e798a221",
      "translationZh": "点击终端 → 立即恢复到 130+ tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8db09386fbce6faa",
      "translationZh": "一开始我以为是 GPU 降频，但问题并不在 GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4a44a79b42d64892",
      "translationZh": "SM 时钟频率实际上更高：2550–2600 MHz，而不是 2100–2200 MHz",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e353b2510389ee2",
      "translationZh": "功率上限相同：400 W",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20e572b44d94670b",
      "translationZh": "PCIe 电源状态没有下降",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5cde1c777d8300ad",
      "translationZh": "decode-host 始终在 390–494 µs 左右",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5b35a9126765e62",
      "translationZh": "差异最大的是 wait：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c8c37fd96f6171e",
      "translationZh": "所以 GPU 并没有变慢。只是服务循环在 CPU 端受到了延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16e538a17a4ef8ae",
      "translationZh": "以分离模式运行服务器（docker run -d / 无界面运行）解决了这个问题：无论焦点在哪个窗口，wait 都保持在 17 ms 左右，吞吐量都保持在 130–200 tok/s 左右。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d39fc1302bd7238",
      "translationZh": "我也在原生 Windows 构建版本上复现了同样的现象，所以这并不是 WSL2 特有的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5273aee040ace0c0",
      "translationZh": "看起来是 Windows 的某种前台/后台 CPU 调度行为导致的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "827132e33fd10c1b",
      "translationZh": "还有人在 Windows 11 上进行本地 LLM 推理时遇到过这种情况吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
